<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Ranking de Jogadores - Início</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background:#f6f7fb; margin:0; }
    .container { max-width: 920px; margin: 64px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
    .card { background:#fff; border-radius:12px; padding:32px; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); text-align:center; }
    a.btn { display:inline-block; margin-top:16px; background:#2563eb; color:#fff; padding:12px 18px; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; }
    a.btn:hover { background:#1e40af; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Ranking de Jogadores (MVC)</h1>
      <p>Cadastre jogadores e veja o ranking por pontuação.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/jogadores">Ir para o Ranking</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>